// Ambient type declarations provided by Expo (CSS modules, global CSS side-effect
// imports, metro require, react-native-web).
//
// Expo's CLI generates an identical reference in `expo-env.d.ts` when the dev server
// runs, but that file is gitignored and machine-local, which left `tsc --noEmit` red
// on every fresh clone. This committed file makes the declarations available to
// TypeScript without needing to start Metro first. Duplicating the reference is
// harmless — TypeScript de-duplicates it.
